0:{"buildId":"iNWCfX8KG4iu7ETtWBmLh","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Optimize Pricing Pages to Increase Checkout Conversion Rates\",\"description\":\"A pricing page that does not convert usually has one of four diagnosable problems. Identify yours before changing the price.\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#founder\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-01-01\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-27\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/learning-centre/pricing-page-not-converting\"},\"image\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/opengraph-image\"}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/learning-centre","className":"text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:text-fg transition-colors","children":"← Learning Centre"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8 md:p-10","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent","children":"Industry Specific · Pricing Page Not Converting"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg md:text-5xl","children":"Optimize Pricing Pages to Increase Checkout Conversion Rates"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Pricing pages confuse instead of guide. Wrong tiers, unclear value, pricing anxiety. Fix the tier structure and proof before the price."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-pricing-page-not-converting&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"The pricing page leak chain"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Most pricing pages lose visitors before they ever see the price. Confusion comes first. Then comparison paralysis. Then fear. Each stage leaks potential customers who might otherwise buy."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"A visitor lands on your pricing page already interested. They scroll looking for clarity. Instead they find tier names that mean nothing, feature lists that blur together, and no clear indication of which option fits them. Confusion turns into comparison paralysis. They can't decide, so they leave \"to think about it.\" They never come back."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Common tier mistakes"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-2 text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"}],"$L3"]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6"]}]]}],"$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb"]}]]}],null,"$Lc"]}],"isPartial":"$@d","staleTime":"$e","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Lf","isPartial":"$@10","staleTime":"$e